    "abstract": "Preliminary illustrated parts figure for the onboard connectivity server rack, the four ceiling wireless access points and the cabin interface hardware, issued to support the pre-analysis of the connectivity modification.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This preliminary figure identifies the connectivity server rack, the four ceiling wireless access points and the cabin interface hardware, and is issued in draft to support the pre-analysis and the retrofit definition.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is preliminary and no item is released for spares provisioning. Access point positions are shown at the nominal cabin stations; the actual positions depend on the cabin layout and are defined per operator on the configuration sheet. The ceiling void routing shown on sheet 2 is indicative only and must be confirmed against the air distribution ducting on each aircraft before installation."
    },
